index=\"0\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1182\"><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">2-  Can I have more information about the Smart Crystal Adhesive Film work's<\/span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle e-font-icon-svg e-fas-angle-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1182\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-labelledby=\"2-can-i-have-more-information-about-the-smart-crystal-adhesive-film-works\"><p>Smart Crystal Adhesive Film operates by utilizing a special polymer dispersed liquid crystal (PDLC) technology, which enables it to switch between opaque and transparent states. When an electrical current is applied, the liquid crystal molecules align, allowing light to pass through and making the film transparent.<\/p><\/div>\n                <\/div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n                <div id=\"3-how-it-can-customize-the-size-of-smart-film-products\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"3\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1183\"><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">3-  How it can customize the size of Smart Film products?<\/span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle e-font-icon-svg e-fas-angle-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1183\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"3\" aria-labelledby=\"3-how-it-can-customize-the-size-of-smart-film-products\"><p class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke \" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"C9DxTc \">If customers need to prepare size as demand for Smart Film, he provide it.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke \" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"C9DxTc \">by we prepare by cutting machines according to sizes request;\u00a0<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke \" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"C9DxTc \">Or he can do not bend or fold the film.\u00a0<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke \" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"C9DxTc \">Ordinary cutting can be done with scissors or a paperknife.\u00a0<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke \" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"C9DxTc \">When cutting, the blade should be inclined at an angle of 45 degrees to the direction of the reserved film, and the light-adjustable film cannot be cut vertically.<\/span><\/p><\/div>\n                <\/div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n                <div id=\"how-about-the-smart-crystal-adhesive-film-have-a-other-color-options\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"4\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1184\"><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">How about the Smart Crystal Adhesive Film have a other color options?<\/span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle e-font-icon-svg e-fas-angle-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1184\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"4\" aria-labelledby=\"how-about-the-smart-crystal-adhesive-film-have-a-other-color-options\"><p class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke \" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"C9DxTc \">Yes. it changes from colored non see through (opaque) to tinted see through.\u00a0<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke \" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"C9DxTc \">It stays colored rather than turning transparent.<\/span><\/p><\/div>\n                <\/div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n                <div id=\"5-is-the-smart-crystal-adhesive-film-controlled-remotely-\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"5\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1185\"><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">5-  Is the Smart Crystal Adhesive Film controlled remotely ?<\/span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle e-font-icon-svg e-fas-angle-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1185\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"5\" aria-labelledby=\"5-is-the-smart-crystal-adhesive-film-controlled-remotely-\"><div class=\"oKdM2c ZZyype\"><div id=\"h.7568987ce3179a6d_234\" class=\"hJDwNd-AhqUyc-uQSCkd Ft7HRd-AhqUyc-uQSCkd jXK9ad D2fZ2 zu5uec\"><div class=\"jXK9ad-SmKAyb\"><div class=\"tyJCtd mGzaTb Depvyb baZpAe\"><ul class=\"n8H08c UVNKR \"><li class=\"zfr3Q TYR86d eD0Rn \" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke \" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Yes. it can be controlled remotely through various methods such as a wall switch, remote control, smartphone app, or home automation system<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n                <\/div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n                <div id=\"6-is-the-smart-crystal-adhesive-film-indoor-and-outdoor-use\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"6\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1186\"><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">6-  Is the Smart Crystal Adhesive Film indoor and outdoor use?<\/span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle e-font-icon-svg e-fas-angle-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1186\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"6\" aria-labelledby=\"6-is-the-smart-crystal-adhesive-film-indoor-and-outdoor-use\"><div class=\"oKdM2c ZZyype\"><div id=\"h.7568987ce3179a6d_234\" class=\"hJDwNd-AhqUyc-uQSCkd Ft7HRd-AhqUyc-uQSCkd jXK9ad D2fZ2 zu5uec\"><div class=\"jXK9ad-SmKAyb\"><div class=\"tyJCtd mGzaTb Depvyb baZpAe\"><p class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke \" dir=\"ltr\">It is not suitable for use in extreme weather conditions, such as high or low temperatures or humid environments, the performance of the smart film may be affected.\u00a0<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n                <\/div><\/div>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-cadc3a2 elementor-section-content-middle elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"cadc3a2\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-322c836\" data-id=\"322c836\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-037caff animated-slow elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"037caff\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">FAQ Installation<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-12a83e4 animated-slow elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-eael-adv-accordion\" data-id=\"12a83e4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:300}\" data-widget_type=\"eael-adv-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t        <div class=\"eael-adv-accordion\" id=\"eael-adv-accordion-12a83e4\" data-scroll-on-click=\"no\" data-scroll-speed=\"300\" data-accordion-id=\"12a83e4\" data-accordion-type=\"accordion\" data-toogle-speed=\"300\">\n    <div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n                <div id=\"1-installation-tips\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1951\"><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">1-  Installation Tips.<\/span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle e-font-icon-svg e-fas-angle-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1951\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-labelledby=\"1-installation-tips\"><p class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke \" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"C9DxTc \">1)<\/span><span class=\"C9DxTc \">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span class=\"C9DxTc \">Each piece of glass must be checked before installation.\u00a0<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke \" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"C9DxTc \">2)<\/span><span class=\"C9DxTc \">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span class=\"C9DxTc \">If there are problems such as wrong size, damaged corners, scratches, abrasions, or incorrect quantities, please do not install.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke \" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"C9DxTc \">3)<\/span><span class=\"C9DxTc \">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span class=\"C9DxTc \">\u00a0Remove residues and other hard objects on the frame.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke \" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"C9DxTc \">4)<\/span><span class=\"C9DxTc \">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span class=\"C9DxTc \">There must be spacers on the window frame, cut the size and quantity according to the manufacturer\u2019s suggestion, and install the standard width and thickness spacers on the window frame.\u00a0<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke \" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"C9DxTc \">5)<\/span><span class=\"C9DxTc \">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span class=\"C9DxTc \">Gaskets can use rubber, wood blocks, and other materials to protect the corners and joints from waterproof and gas-proof edge sealing.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke \" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"C9DxTc \">6)<\/span><span class=\"C9DxTc \">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span class=\"C9DxTc \">Before installing the smart glass, make sure that there are outlet holes or slots in the frame,\u00a0<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke \" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"C9DxTc \">7)<\/span><span class=\"C9DxTc \">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span class=\"C9DxTc \">Pay attention to the connection of the circuit during installation and operate in full accordance with the installation instructions of the circuit.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke \" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"C9DxTc \">8)<\/span><span class=\"C9DxTc \">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span class=\"C9DxTc \">The glass should be installed vertically during installation, and the protective film must not be torn off.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke \" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"C9DxTc \">9)<\/span><span class=\"C9DxTc \">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span class=\"C9DxTc \">When installing the outer frame after the glass is fixed, pay attention to preventing hard objects from touching the glass or welding sparks from burning the glass.<\/span><\/p><\/div>\n                <\/div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n                <div id=\"2-is-possible-to-install-the-mart-crystal-adhesive-film-on-different-types-of-windows-or-glass-surfaces\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1952\"><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">2-  Is possible to install the mart Crystal Adhesive Film on different types of windows or glass surfaces<\/span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle e-font-icon-svg e-fas-angle-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1952\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-labelledby=\"2-is-possible-to-install-the-mart-crystal-adhesive-film-on-different-types-of-windows-or-glass-surfaces\"><p class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke \" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"C9DxTc \">Yes, it is possible to install the Smart Crystal Adhesive Film on various kinds\u00a0 of glass type , like the surfaces, including flat windows, curved windows, glass walls glass partitions, etc.\u00a0<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke \" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"C9DxTc \">This makes Smart Films very flexible and suitable for windows and glazing structures of various designs and configurations.<\/span><\/p><\/div>\n                <\/div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n                <div id=\"3-is-possible-to-install-the-smart-crystal-adhesive-film-on-different-types-of-